{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-glow-and-lovely-hydraglow-rose-enrich-serum-cream-50g-2511-0082d","content_id":"a5a5df6c-466a-43f0-bf94-66973f60b778","description":"Product Safety Report for Glow & Lovely Hydraglow Rose Enrich Serum Cream 50g presenting a serious chemical risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"83f82440-6861-4c16-a5cf-c7a0934c287e","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-04T11:31:44+00:00","id":"83f82440-6861-4c16-a5cf-c7a0934c287e","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-04T11:31:44+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a81820a2495f2d259f1439/2511-0082d-product-safety-report--glow-and-lovely-rose-enrich.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Glow &amp; Lovely Hydraglow Rose Enrich Serum Cream 50g</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as the ingredients list had incorrect ingredients listed and had not specified fragrance allergens.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been withdrawn from the market by Lajawab Foods Limited.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics, personal care and grooming - Skin Care/Moisturising Products</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Glow &amp; Lovely</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>8961014255669</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Pakistan</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Skin cream packaged in a pink and white cardboard box, 50g.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_83f82440-6861-4c16-a5cf-c7a0934c287e\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a81820a2495f2d259f1439/2511-0082d-product-safety-report--glow-and-lovely-rose-enrich.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk as the ingredients list had incorrect ingredients listed and had not specified fragrance allergens. Consumers who are sensitive to certain allergens are not informed and may experience an adverse effect.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of Regulation (EC) 1223/2009 (‘The Cosmetics Regulation’).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market by Lajawab Foods Limited.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend that owners  stop using this product immediately and contact the distributor to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0082d</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-04T11:34:02Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-04","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-04T11:34:02+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-glow-and-lovely-hydraglow-rose-enrich-serum-cream-50g-2511-0082d","api_url":